      "writtenOn": "2023-05-30T21:28:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In this case, most HWs had no real difference w/ or w/o the saturate, but the T880s and T860s were drastically incorrect without the saturate.\n\nI think the only way a user would be expecting something different w/o the saturate would be if they were using the arithmetic blender in SkShaders::Blend, and then further modifying the out-of-gamut values to eventually get into gamut. If they were only using the blender as the final blend, they probably never encountered it.\n\nI will add a release note to call it out, though.",
      "parentUuid": "bd4e0c86_5ae85ed7",
